{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersed in the bleak aftermath of nuclear war, sneak your way through the dystopian streets of New London, shackled under the iron fist of the Puppet Master and his merciless regime. Your sole objective: <strong>Burn it all Down</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is 1986. New London has fallen to the One-Eyed Dominion, a cult-like totalitarian state ruled from the shadows by the enigmatic Puppet Master. Infiltrate the city and employ every means necessary to dismantle their power structure one step at a time. Take aim at key political figures and structures, and peel back the layers of control to answer the question,\u00a0<strong>Who is truly pulling the strings?</strong><br><br>Will you be the catalyst for change, or will the people of New London falter before the <strong>Puppet Master</strong> and succumb to his darkness forever?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773770/extras/40f9c5f15c9f1c74d1d0265507a3eb98.poster.avif?t=1772700346\" width=600 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773770/extras/40f9c5f15c9f1c74d1d0265507a3eb98.webm?t=1772700346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773770/extras/40f9c5f15c9f1c74d1d0265507a3eb98.mp4?t=1772700346\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield a unique arsenal of <strong>incendiary</strong>  <strong>equipment</strong> to wreak havoc on the enemy, from <strong>Molotov cocktails</strong>\u00a0to cannisters of oil, unleash the <strong>fire-bug</strong> within.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A versatile <strong>fire system</strong> - Approach each encounter from a new angle, using <strong>flames</strong> to manipulate, control, and devastate your <strong>enemies.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773770/extras/c9c23e4dcfbd8835ae51496b993b22a0.poster.avif?t=1772700346\" width=600 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773770/extras/c9c23e4dcfbd8835ae51496b993b22a0.webm?t=1772700346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773770/extras/c9c23e4dcfbd8835ae51496b993b22a0.mp4?t=1772700346\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore <strong>hand-crafted environments</strong>\u00a0- Danger lurks behind every corner. Will you go by undetected or go out with a <strong>bang?</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reactive enemies</strong> that will <strong>hear</strong> you coming, dodge your attacks, and <strong>stalk</strong> your every misstep.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773770/extras/12706e1d76b427ca1d3d150be383f2c6.poster.avif?t=1772700346\" width=600 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773770/extras/12706e1d76b427ca1d3d150be383f2c6.webm?t=1772700346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773770/extras/12706e1d76b427ca1d3d150be383f2c6.mp4?t=1772700346\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eliminate</strong> your <strong>enemies</strong> with precision. Take to the shadows or come out guns blazing, the choice is yours.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An\u00a0<strong>expansive sandbox</strong> that allows for player expression - Use any object you can get your hands on to deal whatever carnage you see fit. <strong>Blast</strong> your enemies with a <strong>double-barrelled</strong> shotgun, or  see how far you can get armed with nothing but a wheel of <strong>cheese.</strong> Your playstyle defines the carnage.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2773770?t=1772700346","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773770/5a4a388cfaf19043f6d31138b04bf0595df53987/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772700346","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773770/fc4b0fb558c52048880f67ffcabea4d47651cb35/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772700346","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773770/fc4b0fb558c52048880f67ffcabea4d47651cb35/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772700346","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4456370,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersed in the bleak aftermath of nuclear war, sneak your way through the dystopian streets of New London, shackled under the iron fist of the Puppet Master and his merciless regime. Your sole objective: <strong>Burn it all Down</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is 1986. New London has fallen to the One-Eyed Dominion, a cult-like totalitarian state ruled from the shadows by the enigmatic Puppet Master. Infiltrate the city and employ every means necessary to dismantle their power structure one step at a time. Take aim at key political figures and structures, and peel back the layers of control to answer the question,\u00a0<strong>Who is truly pulling the strings?</strong><br><br>Will you be the catalyst for change, or will the people of New London falter before the <strong>Puppet Master</strong> and succumb to his darkness forever?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773770/extras/40f9c5f15c9f1c74d1d0265507a3eb98.poster.avif?t=1772700346\" width=600 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773770/extras/40f9c5f15c9f1c74d1d0265507a3eb98.webm?t=1772700346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773770/extras/40f9c5f15c9f1c74d1d0265507a3eb98.mp4?t=1772700346\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield a unique arsenal of <strong>incendiary</strong>  <strong>equipment</strong> to wreak havoc on the enemy, from <strong>Molotov cocktails</strong>\u00a0to cannisters of oil, unleash the <strong>fire-bug</strong> within.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A versatile <strong>fire system</strong> - Approach each encounter from a new angle, using <strong>flames</strong> to manipulate, control, and devastate your <strong>enemies.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773770/extras/c9c23e4dcfbd8835ae51496b993b22a0.poster.avif?t=1772700346\" width=600 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773770/extras/c9c23e4dcfbd8835ae51496b993b22a0.webm?t=1772700346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773770/extras/c9c23e4dcfbd8835ae51496b993b22a0.mp4?t=1772700346\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore <strong>hand-crafted environments</strong>\u00a0- Danger lurks behind every corner. Will you go by undetected or go out with a <strong>bang?</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reactive enemies</strong> that will <strong>hear</strong> you coming, dodge your attacks, and <strong>stalk</strong> your every misstep.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773770/extras/12706e1d76b427ca1d3d150be383f2c6.poster.avif?t=1772700346\" width=600 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773770/extras/12706e1d76b427ca1d3d150be383f2c6.webm?t=1772700346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773770/extras/12706e1d76b427ca1d3d150be383f2c6.mp4?t=1772700346\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eliminate</strong> your <strong>enemies</strong> with precision. Take to the shadows or come out guns blazing, the choice is yours.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An\u00a0<strong>expansive sandbox</strong> that allows for player expression - Use any object you can get your hands on to deal whatever carnage you see fit. <strong>Blast</strong> your enemies with a <strong>double-barrelled</strong> shotgun, or  see how far you can get armed with nothing but a wheel of <strong>cheese.</strong> Your playstyle defines the carnage.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Newforge Entertainment"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773770/21f11502a5136142dd12bb8f6527b02bcc26ae7a/header.jpg?t=1772700346","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies"